# PROJECT_CONTEXT → ClickUp BYOFA

`PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` is the **only repo source of truth** for shipped vs planned. Stakeholder-facing copy lives in ClickUp:

- **List:** [Feature Roadmap](https://app.clickup.com/90182722727/v/l/6-901818233981-1)
- **Workspace ID:** `90182722727`
- **List ID:** `901818233981`
- **Space:** BYOFA (`901811109505`)

When you **materially edit** `PROJECT_CONTEXT.md` (feature inventory rows added/removed, status changes, or “Last reviewed”), or the user asks to **sync BYOFA**, **sync ClickUp from PROJECT_CONTEXT**, or **update the roadmap table**, reconcile ClickUp using the **ClickUp MCP** (`user-clickup`).

**Do not sync Notion** for feature roadmap updates unless the user explicitly asks.

There is **no** `docs/feature_roadmap.md` — do not recreate it unless the user asks.

